{
  "endpoint": {
    "method": "GET",
    "path": "/client/sync",
    "controller": "ClientAPIController",
    "controllerFile": "src/main/java/com/ahope/ds/client/controller/ClientAPIController.java",
    "handler": "sync"
  },
  "className": "ClientSyncBlackBoxTest",
  "sqlSlug": "client-sync",
  "docLines": [
    "인증: ClientLoginInterceptor 가 Authorization: Bearer <token> 검증 (세션 로그인 아님).",
    "토큰 누락 -> code 816(MISSING_TOKEN_VALUE), Bearer 접두 없음/복호화 실패 -> code 812(INVALID_TOKEN).",
    "응답: ClientResultMap {code, message, data} (HTTP 200 고정, @ExceptionHandler).",
    "결정적 케이스: 유효 토큰은 KMS 암호화라 재현 불가 -> 인증 거부 경로만 검증."
  ],
  "seedParams": [
    {"name": "ACC", "kind": "seq"}
  ],
  "auth": {"type": "none"},
  "setupSql": "DELETE FROM ACCOUNT_SMS WHERE ACCOUNT_SEQ = ${ACC};",
  "teardownSql": "DELETE FROM ACCOUNT_SMS WHERE ACCOUNT_SEQ = ${ACC};",
  "stubs": [],
  "tests": [
    {
      "name": "VTC_sync_missingAuthorization",
      "comment": "Authorization 헤더 부재 -> 인터셉터가 816 반환",
      "headers": {"X-Manufacturer": "samsung", "X-Model": "SM-G998N", "X-OS-Version": "14", "X-App-Version": "02.00.01"},
      "expectStatus": 200,
      "expectBody": [
        {"path": "code", "equalTo": "816"}
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "VTC_sync_nonBearerAuthorization",
      "comment": "Bearer 접두어 없는 토큰 -> 812",
      "headers": {"X-Manufacturer": "samsung", "X-Model": "SM-G998N", "X-OS-Version": "14", "X-App-Version": "02.00.01", "Authorization": "invalid-token-without-bearer"},
      "expectStatus": 200,
      "expectBody": [
        {"path": "code", "equalTo": "812"}
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "VTC_sync_invalidBearerToken",
      "comment": "복호화 불가한 Bearer 토큰 -> 812",
      "headers": {"X-Manufacturer": "samsung", "X-Model": "SM-G998N", "X-OS-Version": "14", "X-App-Version": "02.00.01", "Authorization": "Bearer not-a-real-encrypted-token"},
      "expectStatus": 200,
      "expectBody": [
        {"path": "code", "equalTo": "812"}
      ]
    }
  ]
}

